## Mutation Testing

After writing tests, validate quality with mutation testing:

| Command | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `yarn stryker:file <source-file>` | Mutation test a single source file |
| `yarn stryker` | Full repo mutation test |
| `yarn stryker:ci` | CI mode with reduced concurrency |

- Mutation score should be >= 30% (enforced threshold, will be ratcheted up)
- Surviving mutants indicate untested code paths — write tests targeting those lines
- In the issue fixer pipeline, mutation testing runs automatically as a server-side gate when reporting fixes
- Do NOT mutate test files — only source files are meaningful targets
- Cap at 5 source files per run to bound runtime (30-120 seconds per file)
-->

## Final Checklist

- [ ] All tests pass
- [ ] Linting errors fixed
- [ ] Coverage thresholds met
